결결정)","date":"2023-10-05","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20231005000093"},{"id":"D16","kind":"DART 공시","title":"주요사항보고서(자기주식취득신탁계약해지결정)","date":"2023-06-08","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20230608000206"},{"id":"D17","kind":"DART 공시","title":"합병등종료보고서(자산양수도)","date":"2023-06-02","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20230602000083"},{"id":"D18","kind":"DART 공시","title":"주요사항보고서(유형자산양도결정)","date":"2023-05-25","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20230525000391"},{"id":"D19","kind":"DART 공시","title":"매출액또는손익구조30%(대규모법인은15%)이상변동","date":"2023-02-03","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20230203900670"},{"id":"R","kind":"DART 사업보고서","title":"사업보고서 (2024.12) 'II. 사업의 내용'","date":"2025-03-18","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20250318000278"}]}